# Evidence and results.
#
# Scratch runs from local experimentation stay out of the tree. The evidence
# the README cites is the product and has to survive a clone -- this file
# previously ignored evidence/ wholesale, so a repo whose README promised
# "backed by committed, hash-signed JSON under evidence/" shipped that
# directory empty. Anything referenced by README.md or rendered into results/
# must be un-ignored here.
evidence/*
!evidence/arm64_ci/
!evidence/stress_malbolge_stress.json
!evidence/cross_python_cross_engine_test.json
!evidence/cross_cobol_cross_engine_test.json
results/*
!results/arm64/
!results/demo/

# Rust
Cargo.lock
